story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids runs 75 years from 1951, and October to November came in under 90% of normal in 42 of them. In 2025 the middle had January to February at 14% of normal and March to April at 223%. So far in 2026 on the middle, February to March sits at 36% and March to April at 37%. Grid 16617 had its driest year in 1956 at 34%.</p>"}
